window.GUIDE.biomes = [{"name":"Forest","when":"Always","body":"Your spawn biome and the default surface everywhere else isn't a special biome. Slimes, Zombies at night, Trees for wood. The safest place to build your first base."},{"name":"Surface and Underground","when":"Always","body":"Below the surface: Copper through Gold ore pairs, Iron/Lead through Silver/Tungsten, plus the first cave enemies. Where most of your pre-boss mining happens."},{"name":"Cavern","when":"Always","body":"Deeper than Underground, darker, tougher enemies, and where the rest of the pre-Hardmode ore (down through Gold/Platinum) and all Hardmode ore after Wall of Flesh concentrate."},{"name":"Desert","when":"Always","body":"Sand as far as you can dig; watch for Antlions underground. Underground Desert below it holds Sandstone, Fossils (Bone/Fossil pickaxe-tier gear) and the desert-specific enemies."},{"name":"Snow biome","when":"Always","body":"Ice terrain with its own ore-independent loot table; home to {{Deerclops}}' spawn condition and, underground, Frost enemies and Ice biome chests."},{"name":"Jungle","when":"Always","body":"Dense vines and tall grass on the surface. Its Underground Jungle layer is where {{Queen Bee}} spawns, where Life Fruit and later Chlorophyte grow, and holds the Jungle Temple gated behind Plantera's Temple Key."},{"name":"Corruption and Crimson","when":"Always (one or the other per world)","body":"The world's \"evil\" biome, chosen at world creation. Corruption has chasms and Demonite Ore/Shadow Orbs; Crimson has fleshy crimson patches and Crimtane Ore/Crimson Hearts. Home to {{Eater of Worlds}} or {{Brain of Cthulhu}}."},{"name":"Ocean","when":"Always","body":"At the far east and west map edges. Home to the {{Angler}} NPC's fishing quests, {{Duke Fishron}}'s summon condition, and Ocean-exclusive fish/crates."},{"name":"Dungeon","when":"Always","body":"A locked structure guarded by {{Old Man}} until {{Skeletron}} is defeated. Afterward it's a dense pre-Hardmode-to-Hardmode dungeon full of biome-specific loot, keys, and the Cultists that spawn Lunatic Cultist after Golem."},{"name":"Underworld","when":"Always","body":"The very bottom of the map, made of ash and lava. Source of {{Hellstone}}, Obsidian, and where {{Wall of Flesh}} is fought on a horizontal bridge."},{"name":"The Hallow","when":"Hardmode only","body":"Appears the moment Wall of Flesh dies, a rainbow/crystal biome opposite the evil biome. Source of Pearlstone, Hardmode Hallowed enemies, {{Queen Slime}}'s and {{Empress of Light}}'s spawn conditions."},{"name":"Glowing Mushroom biome","when":"Always (grows near Mud)","body":"A glowing blue mushroom patch that grows near Mud Blocks underground, often bordering the Jungle. Home to the Truffle NPC's spawn condition once in Hardmode, and its own mushroom-themed loot."},{"name":"Granite Cave","when":"Always (Cavern mini-biome)","body":"A pocket of granite blocks and Granite Golem/Granite Elemental enemies within the Cavern layer, worth a detour for the Granite-tile vanity loot."},{"name":"Marble Cave","when":"Always (Cavern mini-biome)","body":"A pocket of marble/statues with Pillar/Medusa-adjacent enemies within the Cavern layer, and a chance at rare vanity/weapon drops."},{"name":"Meteorite","when":"Once you have enough Bars","body":"A small crash-site biome that appears after mining enough Iron/Lead. Home to {{Meteorite}} ore, burns on contact without fire-immunity gear."},{"name":"Space","when":"Always (high altitude)","body":"The very top of the map. Home to Floating Islands, Wyverns, and where the {{Celestial Pillars (Solar, Vortex, Nebula, Stardust)}} fight often ranges into."}];
